      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86eec39f7dc87b7039778c9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦~~",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f9f0730bf9ed218a57159f4cd86dbd758391f55b01150fb80a3a94d8ccae9a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ca718ff868164b09156b0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇啊啊啊啊啊~……早上好~\n今天也谢谢你的起床电话。\n……明天也拜托了♡呐~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "c764ea95740b61d29e16fd25979303984650380b98b485c6a077d5c46aa77244",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:777f7de45b9a5603a7f9a08b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好~！……呐！\n快看快看我今天的超好状态！\n很天才吧？很天才吧~~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc0b684b0f0d80a88a195e939309d7a2026a9e5f85ab4f4b7ca34fb5a09bdc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:828f26d1965b49b3239aa7a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜欸欸~训练员救救我！\n小心心要把我带到山上去~！明明\n只是让她帮我脱了一下衣服而已~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f89650e73bf436fe76ab8ac7001a85fb765119fd519bebbcbfc067a06a40482",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73b4a98aac71c8524170ae5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶~？训练~？\n现在很困就不去了~\n你要是愿意带我去的话也行哦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d54a41597234db49632831bd08b60338727a3f4d6d79274d46d993597f91c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3981d17ca87f62d28844f57f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊~今天也超努力的！作为奖励\n来拆一套高档化妆品好了~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "956cb7866b3b61e06b089351b1d6ac07950f188cffe163fe9271d29c5e357aba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54f14d25b8ec689214c09184",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……课程作业？\n没事的♡\n只要做起来就能马上完成♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d5e5fd41e9d3246d367b519748c084f5a07626dd20ae0357d2e991814e32887",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5742b251c3594f4952dbfe67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~你知道小茵前辈吗？\n……真是的~一到这个季节\n她就马上会跑去晒太阳~",
      "source_fingerprint": "edb64bff6bfb49d593eccfd0a92c19638d583982e1a14d77f35b58d6afd41299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e929503a00456d384c83f5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热~~！要化了~~！\n今天就做室内训练行吗~！\n呐~~~拜托啦~~~~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d30edcb0a5afb94cfc357aa8eb96d3f712a9f453709faada53de66c59e60492",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:625636239beacca1925b8d4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "话说有没有想吃芋头？毕竟秋天了！\n栗子也可以~总之，去喝下午茶吧！\n好就这么定了♡♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e696a9baed3efbc6aa3eaaf62ffb0b901246ad90f8d2cc910c4b941c8450b58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3493952d33cd3b27283f3b0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好……冷！要、要冻僵了……！\n……呐，训练员！那个……\n今天要不改为室内训练吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cb7bb307682924b33cf466b6161ad5e6d00e7abc1e2ceb5fde43ad788857c76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d399f0eae52030c0d52ec61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝活很流行啊~我试着做了瑜伽♪\n……毕竟都这么努力了~\n吃个薄煎饼悠闲度过吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f9a663ddc0270717940694eb740af3b9adc8c6129202a28a93376ccbb42b98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76637267df5d765850da5269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哇~……呐，要不来做一下冥想吧？\n好像有大人物说过冥想有利于健康呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8483832d24eb6c7e2acbb4658e8d3889917eda3abba0f9bd7b53aef36a9475b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcb5bc74d2e016aded62d55f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放学后~先要去拍大头贴吧？\n然后是吃吃可丽饼，打打保龄球~\n……在那之前要先训练？哈诶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59769994ba88d62233d5a29486e2465c5d79c366d4faf46165d7f1629d13ecaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94e7b984d1f4577cbc17ddbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的课好烦人啊。\n啊，帮我准备点高级水果\n和珍珠奶茶吧。上完课就去找你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64effe2769bfc9d7eb12c669bcb422db155e0d97e9d380043981f725d44d933d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0618729b03ea88c8469ca56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗完澡用来吃的冰淇淋没有啦~\n呜欸~！这样下去我会动不了……\n动不了的呢~偷瞄♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "895d62e750d0706ca3ede29f4042b0c35fa0109a7490c0c50bf80b97e48f133d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deb863558720fde6db13a8e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜。小心心她啊，老是作业作业的……\n啊，对了！用揉肩和美式点心\n让她放过我吧~",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c446cd1ba284c4efec16186a3d4f9c2ef678b2a0152ee3772467a5adaa5262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f4f2fa54a31a0940862f605",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和小茵前辈去赏花了，\n回过神来已经一起大睡了，\n我们总是会这样呢！呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5030a19505953dcf41e17402e3d1c47479bf5a4e27a9418903a77656d5101c35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2491ae06b7046fcfa38c50c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要来我的私人海滩吗？\n有超~漂亮的大海，\n别墅里还有游艇哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b75dbf14699552c977ed61eb0bbd4358e66b916e02f9eeb76d9b20128f4ba407",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f30d6ec94e22d40612bd2925",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "话说——最近连秋天都很热啊~！\n难道说季节会减少？……管它呢，\n反正还能穿泳装也不错！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "775f915d1b36f4d2427ee699f38b5880ab4992d962f6a294ca8d633baebc8d2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4912c4da806282342caf5e7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想在雪屋里装枝形吊灯~\n还要放上梳妆台！所以……\n要做个又大又结实的哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "405b5ca9a772a1d2d9a724292231e138db8093cb13fe56c68096cb46d84a2ef3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0e621f612cc303e246032bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ffa58a82ebf8bcdc733cb49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be7254e12a96153ca740e582",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎~真是搞不懂宝穴前辈！\n明明自己动不动就喜欢拍肩膀，\n为什么就讨厌抱抱呢~！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44bafb2f454597d35755973197956e6ece7eb99ae2d055cc8a907351f90b730d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4319641e47cd38509132a5af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小目的便当到手~♡\n吃了这个我的天才力就能提升♪\n下次休息日再让她帮我做好了♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "8086845d257ad8448bb118bf252b56f0fb30c0c7b7e42cbe099250714ab96076",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed4dc6b0f27ec06e705e2667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽又闪闪发光的东西\n我都超~~~~喜欢♡♡\n公主战士的联名化妆品我绝对要买♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e2a2c5ad7d9c9b7634424afce39d139eefd59054e60aead680868e7d1ef3a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7228997a150461129c49769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~你知道我的耳机跑哪去了吗？\n真是糟透了……我超喜欢这副耳机的\n……嘛，再去买一副就行了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "25442bd0ee3fc94d28a04d4629d5a08370c687ffc22d5751b9e77a9c9ce86e6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692edb1b2d97acde65a484b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了？别因为\n人家可爱就看得这么入迷啦~♡\n……欸不是吗？别害羞嘛~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c62eb9db594a986f48aa127a7e9c99f35f8763986dddda0a1581229fa3791eff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3716dbd934a36d5b43652ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？很合适吧~♡♡\n虽然会更喜欢更华丽一点的……\n不过我长得这么天才完全没问题♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "012329b45743968956323073daf3d53473ff4f1dddafae358ce41d7d7c46dc81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2845489955aa22086eb1d4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得有配套衣服~\n想找人一起拍个Umatok呢♪\n欸嘿嘿~要找谁呢♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "106ee4154d691dbe1e84bed9a2df2b63cf44fe1d7a0f0ae27277300ffce9aab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef8e8b321e5a024cb9f68cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿~这套决胜服真天才♡\n袖子的透明感~花边和蝴蝶结~\n还有身为设计者的我全都很天才♡♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb06074a2ab9c1371f8883b76b45bcdf483cdf1e13cfbe8be4c71e5ca90f8344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:947ccc418f68d213ac92146a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜~太失败了！\n装饰做得太多了啦~~！！\n清洗时要一个个取下来麻烦死了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b11c5cb013c393bc4d78e255651cecad73dac6917f0a02c414d609e9b836909",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3199b13b18d46fbd6757bdc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真是的~干嘛啦。\n早上起来脸肿了，\n不过肿了也很可爱就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f88705863b8b9d2adf47af8694780927d5273ea2b77c7e29a83709c1dff793c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47fbc4e89188d7829e1ed6eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇啊啊啊啊啊啊。\n……嗯~好想午睡。\n去训练员室睡好了~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02b984fa1e45f00345b464df0d25ac0b3fcc4f5587487389c73277d5da1fdd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e6b52d67012b70e7c067727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼、哼、哼！\n能赢过本天才少女潘多拉酱吗~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f257f4b4c46cb5edb06a54c5d319e5b04e624e202bd57878d5ebd357ffc216b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:311e7ecde7906d2b8abb78ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~~！说好的一起看剧呢~~？\n还不行吗？都到这个时间了~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "182d9f51f3aa8b5ab86d0092f2f543611c446fb1aca4583889350d1925c9851e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310aa61538174be619203837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼~♪ \n下次要穿什么样的衣服呢~♪\n春天到了……露点皮肤之类的？♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc3497a1bdbe41ca190c694a29e54944bf2f697da71e73aef0c2fd128ec39b75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4c48586517b5db672f8443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐！今年一定要去爸爸的度假村\n训练好吗！我会每天都穿\n不一样的可爱夏装给你看的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94b5de79ed5e825bec477b5fed957099c02802c9d158e4b495836062016a57d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d7ee251007449b7a0c36064",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜~温差太大了~~~~\n真的要感冒了。\n只要吃了东西就能马上好~",
      "source_fingerprint": "127fc55d9433b51ca474d0d2f26ca73240ba0c59aa56ef6b349415cf14141aab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47e5278ce67423e1a36e718e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超天才的我可不能输给那些\n打算用上暖宝宝的人……\n……不，我应该能！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec4d354d3b41d0bde8c696e611d20d170c301ffb2e14cb9aef618fb58077854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d282b81824cd8357fb4f775",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "买了一大堆点心~♡\n……不是，才不是我贪吃啦！\n这是为了让小目开心~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9df710a37925ab3b490e39d2d8bce958669eac437e69c0215b359523b5c87cdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ae6591cd976a61d33e75f99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "镜子啊镜子~第二可爱的人是谁？\n这么说了之后被吐槽了~\n毕竟第一可爱的都不用问吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d93feec29e27de2c893e6a9f354c218746b25767a0aed6fed8bc05e23fb164ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340adb13c5c556f1592dcde2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和统治前辈玩桌游超~开心的！\n不过之前被我完虐后\n她就把自己关进房间了呢~",
      "source_fingerprint": "2de4b104786301c1d1b1cb5906df44d0419dc325422b6072398f89218a9bfa6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:442fee5c54aacb87f223538a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和川上前辈去看了公主战士的演出\n超开心的♪\n之后又在宿舍大厅聊了3个小时！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e70f5ea46bc5fd8182d33d57644f5c19f4311775ae1608c2656367f13523904",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e986674571c5c69282eeb65e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "房间变脏也能瞬间干净的魔法☆\n……之类的，不知道小东商\n会不会愿意教我呢~",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7ee9203b7c71592da320a9096100d9a26cc37bb6758d5b7d46cd79dbd3a755b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c186b10fe9366e4cc94c8e56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小心心，讲真…早上也太早了…\n好困，不行，撑不住了…！呐~枕头。\n你坐那边…坐下嘛~！就现在~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34d1782ba10512a5fa0fca9391cfeeaa389713951f80b200fb0b4c45719aa3e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f823c4fa3fc72ff266e95630",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿这身吃午餐的话，果然得是\n夏威夷盖饭！欸——想去夏威夷~\n带我去吧♡坐头等舱去♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "21206caf7dfebd86bc82bdb3664823923c32f3789ecd7b0e02bf242df751fec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a788c7fd2f00eced90fb4d8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小茵前辈的paka玩偶，\n抱着能睡得很香呢！\n有种暖暖的感觉~！呵呵♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5ec218e0240d53523192720ac5401737dd13123f472156e8e32de431e908197",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a63aa1ecc690c1a3917bd67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸——新生们都超~可爱！\n我也要展现一下前辈风范~♪\n首先是~……嗯~……晒太阳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7066407e9fef81dc48310bd25fdab5e635e7f9abd1e9aa512cdf539f590bf47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16fc38fa0e5a3e32ab38fd8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇~好热~……想喝蜜瓜苏打~！\n里面放有樱桃、蜜瓜、芒果……\n再撒上金粉的那种！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e24ce608bf8b82f6131389178fbdac862558e8a7ada03f4f4bb4902952726d3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af46e5cfc6bcbf726066da39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本来很怕不良漫画~但从宝穴前辈\n那里借来读过之后……简直迷上这种\n愛羅武勇（I love you）的感觉了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0d66533faf3406cca325279466acfd2d53b8db561bc54fb0b4e79c74f838563",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54fc6ed74f30379ccbeb405d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在努力收集狗狗玩偶！\n真希望爱慕律动前辈\n也能来参加暗锅女王杯呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cecbae20acc656c6580de705375f8f599c16b7567655d483d7b4461ac6d2c6a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d38bde9f0a987395fa97eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做了以小目为印象的挑染~！\n这下我们就一样了~\n简直是最强闪亮亮组合~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad84554e8d31fb5f076811de5ac674b6a32c5465ddf6ddac035815adad7b8fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:121bca1953898944e29510e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套泳装超可爱的吧！？\n还有穿着它的我也是……♡\n……呐——就没什么想说的吗~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41db7c66aef64781862a0ac5dabdb71f4b0d0dc960e53ef841e781025c3804dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6a123f8db3c4a5d1a170705",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂我说啊！别让天才等啊~！\n真是的~……不过我的胸怀\n也像天才一样宽广，就原谅你了♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "9568f4e5955572284ff6b708cfe6a1f865246f12df6f9f342fe91ced005fc34f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e162dcef82d492d28d384342",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直待在学园也太无聊了……\n要不今天出门吧？好不好？好主意♡\n顺便再去喝一下新品拿铁好啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "19829e96dc5b46ba0d7480afb413b2b8f92d9c7c6647c50134f5f084b10db3a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:956dd2bb7e03c8b6d05d2d05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛—嘛—\n只要努努力就能赢的啦~！\n毕竟是我嘛♡♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "de0fc0739ee5bc7840d4b9d8329ca8f9f1c84f8e79024af0afac425ab0367bd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb8fde7cbd5360249e455040",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊~真是的，到底要怎么办呢~~~\n维持现状？开创新风格？\n每次做发型都好烦恼啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "21a05d03cbb27b43e20406137373061bc1e81ae27f61511e3b04fab398ea91ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e04da2d656ee793fe941f41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~今天的训练会很严格吗？\n会很累吗？可以稍微轻松一点吗？\n泪眼汪汪……♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b64fea962515aef180b44b167cde08fae02acd097f91f7efa6aa24f90647c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d8204778e7298ae186ca20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞！今天要好好加油！\n……嘻嘻♡ 就算是我\n也会有能鼓起干劲的日子啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b0408cd658166bd7b606c01373e674376d28813e4e6ec68836ddf7557248a39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42c2c215b40eabb70ec7564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦也没关系哦~\n这是你制定的日程不是吗？\n所以，我会好好认真加油的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d1eba8e51fa1b538a3d482b15ae8843072a0e5871d2088feefc7de015338396",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13341414565f871ef4fd8827",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热~……训练员，我要遮阳伞~\n还有卫衣和防晒霜~\n再加一份街边摊的胡萝卜冰沙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71a3d6eebd0ec16fb49eca4059bdd8f15af42200209c5d8fefde4b9e18a3bc1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11b5592187c2efb691af2573",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？差不多该办场时尚秀了吧？\n超有魅力潘多拉专属的那种♡\n……诶！！不办吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb8ddb8b1ca251b8829baf58d5c568cf6adf6a6f482202c596b4a377ebdcfca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e516b2e03764eb43245fc6cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我来决定训练内容！\n那个~……嗯~……\n……总之先去海边？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae40de4b83807a6e192431fb08e2cc99d46b98bd686ece2895a6c1159d51c314",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "92016"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
